      "@type": "Dataset",
      "@id": "dataset:era5-land",
      "identifier": "era5-land",
      "name": "ERA5-Land land surface reanalysis meteorological data (ERA5-Land)",
      "description": "ERA5-Land is a regular grid product for global land surface reanalysis. It is suitable for constructing long-term, continuous, and reproducible exposures to temperature, precipitation, wind speed, and soil moisture for studies in China; it is not a CMA site readout and cannot alone address microsite-constrained issues.",
